# Thunder Wave, Charge), 4 PELIPPER, 5 FERALIGATR. TM70 (Flash) is in the bag since chain 05 (Elder Li,
# scr_seq_0018_D15R0103.s:124); teaching through the Bag is not botted, so the boost gives the move: AMPHAROS takes TM70
# (files/poketool/personal/personal.json), in Charge's place.
party-move 3 3 MOVE_FLASH
